Cra: Safe Browsing list updates at most once a day while Cra runs, plus the
one shortly after launch. All of Cra shares one Google API key and its daily
quota (10,000 list updates); Chrome's ~30 minute interval would cover a few
hundred installs. A new phishing site can take until the next launch or day
to be blocked.

